Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.19,Mitsudomoe Default,,0,0,0,,Vinte e... cinco.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.40,0:10:36.90,Mitsudomoe Default,,0,0,0,,Vinte e seis...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.53,Mitsudomoe Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:39.78,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur.5\bord7\fs100\fnPaper Johnny Eins\c&HE8E8E8&\3c&H0B0B0B&\frz339.634\move(141,309,110,308,0,1235)}{\t(0,0,(\fs110))}Pah
