Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:14.19,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs35\bord1\b1\fnSweet as candy\c&HF0EFED&\3c&H807B7F&\frz359.353\pos(745.67,171.33)}Cororon {\r\c&H6223C6&\bord1\fs35\b1\blur1}MKII
